# Web UI

Follow `docs/THEME.md`. Paper background, cream surfaces, ink text, primary accent `#FC4903` only.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<div className="bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-500 to-indigo-500 shadow-2xl animate-bounce">

// ✅ GOOD
<section className="rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-5">
```

- Transitions 160ms. No page-load animations.
- `components/ui` primitives only. Do not add another component library.
- Daily work is a writing surface. Chat is a conversation surface. Home is not a dashboard.
